				<r3d:description language="eng">The Centre for Clinical Trials Cologne (Köln ZKS) aims to support all processes of clinical trials and the quality of patient-oriented clinical research in an academic environment. It supports doctors of University Hospital of Cologne, other clinics, study groups and professional associations in the design and conduct of clinical trials. For the pharmaceutical industry and contract research organizations, the ZKS Köln is a clinic near partner for medical research projects.</r3d:description>
